<title>USA: KeraVision gets European marketing OK.</title>
<headline>KeraVision gets European marketing OK.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>KeraVision Inc said it got regulatory approval in Europe to market its first product, the KeraVision(R) Ring for the treatment of nearsightedness.</p>
<p>The ring is currently in Phase III of U.S. Food and Drug Administration clinical trials. Final FDA approval is a couple of years away, said spokesman Mick Taylor.</p>
<p>The company has targeted France and Germany for initial European commercialization, and it anticipates its first revenues in December from Germany.</p>
</text>
